I ascended recently (you'll find the thread somewhere here) with a
wizard. They're a bit difficult in the beginning of the game, but once
you make it to the castle, you have a quite good chance to ascend, as
they can cast many usefull spells later -- namely magic missile, magic
mapping, finger of death, identify and remove curse. Plus, you start
with some really nice stuff and have 98% chance to write unknown
scrolls and spellbooks with max luck.
Although everyone recommends Valkyre, if you want to try something,
give Wizard a try.

